{"headword":"נְקָמָה","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.f. vengeance (</strong>on format. cf. Lag<sup>BN 143</sup><strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 46:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.46.10\">Je 46:10</a> + 3 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִקְמַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:2\" href=\"/Numbers.31.2\">Nu 31:2</a> + 7 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִקְמָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 25:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.25.14\">Ez 25:14</a> + 7 times sfs.; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְקָמוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 11:36\" href=\"/Judges.11.36\">Ju 11:36</a> + 5 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">נְקָמֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:48\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.48\">2 S 22:48</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>vengeance</em> of God, abs. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 25:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.25.14\">Ez 25:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נקם נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:36\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.36\">Je 51:36</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נִקְמַת דַּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 79:10\" href=\"/Psalms.79.10\">ψ 79:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵל נְקָמוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 94:1\" href=\"/Psalms.94.1\">94:1</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵת נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.6\">Je 51:6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹם נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 46:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.46.10\">Je 46:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳ יהוה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:15\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.15\">50:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:28\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.28\">28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.11\">51:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳ הֵיכָלוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:28\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.28\">50:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.11\">51:11</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span> of adversary, <span dir=\"rtl\">נתן נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 25:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.25.14\">Ez 25:14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 25:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.25.17\">17</a